# First Horde raptor from Zjolnir (Sen'jin Village).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: one Riding skill (Apprentice 75 from level 40, Journeyman 150
# at 60). Training costs 100g and 1,000g (Forever's world data: the trainers of
# Velma Warnam and Genn Fairweather, build 70124) and comes with a mount
# (Blizzard). ItemSparse lists the mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60)
# for every race of the faction, but each one also needs Raptor Riding (10861;
# MountCapability), which SkillLineAbility gives only Trolls with Riding: the
# faction's other races and the Skyborne must learn it.
# ASSUMED: Xar'Ti teaches it to them at Exalted with Darkspear Trolls (Classic
# rule; a beta player guide says other races' mounts need Exalted). In-game
# check: a Orc at Xar'Ti, with and without Exalted.
# ASSUMED: Honored with your race's home city takes 10% off training and mounts
# (beta player guides; Classic had the same). In-game check: the price at Honored.

step Learn to ride
  zone Durotar
  tip Xar'Ti and Zjolnir's raptors are in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast. At 40 Xar'Ti teaches Riding to Trolls for 100g (10% less at Honored with Darkspear Trolls), and it comes with a raptor. Other races learn Riding, with their own first mount, at their own race's riding trainer.
  level 40
  train 7953 only Troll               -- Xar'Ti, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Raptor Riding for other races
  only Orc,Tauren,Undead,Skyborne
  when !knows 10861
  tip Any Horde race can buy these raptors, but riding one also takes Raptor Riding, which only Trolls get with Riding. Xar'Ti teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with Darkspear Trolls (the Darkspear Trolls Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a raptor for this character.
  rep "Darkspear Trolls" Exalted
  train 7953                          -- Xar'Ti, Raptor Riding

step Pick a colour
  tip Zjolnir sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 7952                         -- Zjolnir
  buy 8588 npc 7952 optional          -- Whistle of the Emerald Raptor, 20g
  buy 8591 npc 7952 optional          -- Whistle of the Turquoise Raptor, 20g
  buy 8592 npc 7952 optional          -- Whistle of the Violet Raptor, 20g
